[176.343683, "o", "m\n\u001b[38;5;189m1. Open this URL in your web browser to authorize the node:\u001b[121X\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;35;1m\u001b]8;id=755170056;https://auth.sam-mesh.dev/auth?audience=sam-mesh-audience&client_id=sam-mesh-audience&code_challenge=mxtvOBa9zzvGi_KJRxfPyhlKvo-yxS73Nhfsv67NkVI&code_challenge_method=S256&redirect_uri=urn%3Aietf%3Awg%3Aoauth%3A2.0%3Aoob&response_type=code&scope=openid+email+profile&state=L7NW4r3kUsxOk-agKxw2gA\u0007SAM Mesh Authorization\u001b[38;5;189;22m\u001b]8;;\u0007 \u001b[38;5;30;4m\u001b]8;id=755170056;https://auth.sam-mesh.dev/auth?audience=sam-mesh-audience&client_id=sam-mesh-audience&code_challenge=mxtvOBa9zzvGi_KJRxfPyhlKvo-yxS73Nhfsv67NkVI&code_challenge_method=S256&redirect_uri=urn%3Aietf%3Awg%3Aoauth%3A2.0%3Aoob&response_type=code&scope=openid+email+profile&state=L7NW4r3kUsxOk-agKxw2gA\u0007https://auth.sam-mesh.dev/auth?audience=sam-mesh-audience&client_id=sam-mesh-audience&code_challenge=mxtvOBa9zzvGi_KJRxfPyhlKvo-\u001b[38;5;189;24m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[29X\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;30;4m\u001b]8;id=755170056;https://auth.sam-mesh.dev/auth?audience=sam-mesh-audience"]
[176.343709, "o", "&client_id=sam-mesh-audience&code_challenge=mxtvOBa9zzvGi_KJRxfPyhlKvo-yxS73Nhfsv67NkVI&code_challenge_method=S256&redirect_uri=urn%3Aietf%3Awg%3Aoauth%3A2.0%3Aoob&response_type=code&scope=openid+email+profile&state=L7NW4r3kUsxOk-agKxw2gA\u0007yxS73Nhfsv67NkVI&code_challenge_method=S256&redirect_uri=urn%3Aietf%3Awg%3Aoauth%3A2.0%3Aoob&response_type=code&scope=openid+email+profile&state=L7NW4r3kUsxOk-agKxw2gA\u001b[38;5;189;24m\u001b]8;;\u0007             \u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;189m2. After logging in, the page will give you an \u001b[1mauthorization code\u001b[22m.\u001b[114X\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;189m3. \u001b[1mPaste that code here in the chat\u001b[22m.\u001b[144X\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;189m\u001b[180X\u001b[m\n\u001b[38;5;189mOnce you provide the code, I'll send it to the setup process and finish starting up the local \u001b[38;5;111;48;5;236msam-node\u001b[38;5;189;49m and exploring the mesh!\u001b[54X\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[38;5;238m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[38;5;111;"]
[176.343719, "o", "1m> jp2ekbobpfgmqdvzojzddyhg5\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[38;5;146m▸ Thought for 1s, 293 tokens\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[38;5;146m  Reviewing Authentication Code\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[38;5;111m●\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;214;1mManageTask\u001b[38;5;146;22m(send_input 8444cce5-beab-4803-ba8b-86fec8ea517d/task-11)\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;146m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[38;5;146m▸ Thought for 4s, 107 tokens\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[38;5;146m  Checking Task Status\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[38;5;111m●\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;214;1mManageTask\u001b[38;5;146;22m(status 8444cce5-beab-4803-ba8b-86fec8ea517d/task-11)\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;146m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[38;5;146m▸ Thought for 7s, 58 tokens\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[38;5;146m  Initiating Daemonization Process\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[38;5;111m●\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;214;1mBash\u001b[38;5;146;22m(sam-node run --daemonize)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[38;5;111m●\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;214;1mManageTask\u001b[38;5;146;22m(status 8444cce5-beab-4803-ba8b-86fec8ea517d/task-22)\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;146m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[38;5;146m▸ Thought for 7s, 172 tokens\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[38;5;146m  Checking Daemonization Status\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[38;5;111m●\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;214;1mBash\u001b[38;5;146;22m(curl -s --unix-socket ~/.config/sam-mesh/sam."]
[176.343727, "o", "sock http://localhost/v1/models)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[38;5;111m●\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;214;1mManageTask\u001b[38;5;146;22m(status 8444cce5-beab-4803-ba8b-86fec8ea517d/task-26)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[38;5;111m●\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;214;1mBash\u001b[38;5;146;22m(cat /home/aojea/.config/sam-mesh/api-token)\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;146m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[38;5;146m▸ Thought Process\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[38;5;146m  Demonstrating Mesh Connection\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;189mAwesome, we've successfully authenticated and the \u001b[38;5;111;48;5;236msam-node\u001b[38;5;189;49m has been started locally!\u001b[96X\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;189m\u001b[180X\u001b[m\n\u001b[38;5;39;1m### What just happened?\u001b[38;5;189;22m\u001b[157X\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;189m\u001b[180X\u001b[m\n\u001b[38;5;189m1. We fetched an authorization code and joined the \u001b[1mOSS Agent Mesh (SAM)\u001b[22m.\u001b[108X\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;189m2. We launched \u001b[38;5;111;48;5;236msam-node\u001b[38;5;189;49m in the background (daemonized), establishing your entry point into the SAM network.\u001b[73X\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;189m\u001b[180X\u001b[m\n\u001b[38;5;39;1m### 1. Reaching SAM capabilities directly (HTTP/Unix socket)\u001b[38;5;189;22m\u001b[120X\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;189m\u001b[180X\u001b[m\n\u001b[3"]
[176.343737, "o", "8;5;189mSince the \u001b[38;5;111;48;5;236msam-node\u001b[38;5;189;49m is running locally, we can reach it without needing any tokens if we use its Unix socket. This is perfect for querying SAM's connected AI models.\u001b[16X\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;189m\u001b[180X\u001b[m\n\u001b[38;5;189mFor instance, I just automatically queried \u001b[38;5;111;48;5;236m/v1/models\u001b[38;5;189;49m across the mesh and found two endpoints available:\u001b[76X\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;189m\u001b[180X\u001b[m\n\u001b[38;5;189m• \u001b[38;5;111;48;5;236mgoogle/gemma-2-2b-it\u001b[38;5;189;49m\u001b[158X\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;189m• \u001b[38;5;111;48;5;236mopenrouter/auto\u001b[38;5;189;49m\u001b[163X\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;189m\u001b[180X\u001b[m\n\u001b[38;5;189mWe can send a chat completion request directly to a mesh model. Here's an example you can run straight in your terminal to see it in action:\u001b[40X\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;189m\u001b[180X\u001b[m\n\u001b[38;5;189m  \u001b[38;5;251mcurl --unix-socket ~/.config/sam-mesh/sam.sock \u001b[38;5;158m\\\u001b[38;5;189m\u001b[130X\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;189m  \u001b[38;5;251m  \u001b]8;id=jke32253df;http://localhost/v1/chat/completions\u0007http://localhost/v1/chat/completions\u001b]8;;\u0007 \u001b[38;5;1"]
[176.343744, "o", "58m\\\u001b[38;5;189m\u001b[138X\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;189m  \u001b[38;5;251m  -H \u001b[38;5;173m'Content-Type: application/json'\u001b[38;5;251m \u001b[38;5;158m\\\u001b[38;5;189m\u001b[139X\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;189m  \u001b[38;5;251m  -d \u001b[38;5;173m'{\"model\": \"google/gemma-2-2b-it\", \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Hello from the SAM mesh demo!\"}]}'\u001b[38;5;189m\u001b[62X\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;189m\u001b[180X\u001b[m\n\u001b[38;5;39;1m### 2. Discovering remote APIs and Tools\u001b[38;5;189;22m\u001b[140X\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;189m\u001b[180X\u001b[m\n\u001b[38;5;189mYou can give agents (like me!) access to networked tools. The mesh nodes discover these using the MCP (Model Context Protocol). Here's how to configure me to have first-class      \u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;189maccess to a\u001b[169X\u001b[m\r\n⢿  \u001b[38;5;109mGenerating...\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[38;5;238m─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
[176.343753, "o", "────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[38;5;111m>\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[38;5;238m─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[38;5;109mesc to cancel\u001b[m\u001b[158X\u001b[158C\u001b[38;5;109mGemini 3.1 Pro\u001b[m\r\u001b[2A\u001b[2C\u001b[?25h"]
[176.390371, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[3A\u001b[11C\u001b[38;5;189mny tools run\u001b[m\r\n⣻ \n\n\u001b[?25h"]
