[329.843297, "o", "ry\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;189m\u001b[26X\u001b[m\n\u001b[38;5;39;1m### 3. Describe and Call a Remote Tool\u001b[38;5;189;22m    \u001b[m\r\n\n  \u001b[38;5;189mBefore calling a remote tool, the safety protocol requires me to pull its schema over the network to know how to use it safely. I called \u001b[38;5;111;48;5;236mdescribe_remote_tool\u001b[38;5;189;49m on the \u001b[38;5;111;48;5;236mecho\u001b[38;5;189;49m tool and\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;189mlearned it accepts a \u001b[38;5;111;48;5;236mmessage\u001b[38;5;189;49m parameter.\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;189m\u001b[178X\u001b[m\n\u001b[38;5;189mI then ran \u001b[38;5;111;48;5;236mcall_remote_tool\u001b[38;5;189;49m to execute code on that remote computer across the mesh, and it responded flawlessly:\u001b[m\r\n\n  \u001b[38;5;189m│ \u001b[1mResult from remote peer:\u001b[22m \u001b[38;5;111;48;5;236mEcho: Hello from the Antigravity Agent across the SAM Mesh!!\u001b[38;5;189;49m\u001b[26X\u001b[m\r\n\n  \u001b[38;5;189mThis mea\u001b[54X\u001b[m\n\n\n\n\u001b[8D\u001b[?25h"]
